# EON SVN r2549, Fortran linked, unpatched. Stock steepest descent on the archive force norm.
# HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel is r2549 Morse::force. sd_alpha stays at the default 0.1 and max_move at 0.2.
# The step sits on that cap, the force norm oscillates, and every start reaches the 10000-call budget.
counter harness
count_keys HarnessCounter
code EON (SVN r2549)
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm SD
tuning stock
template eon-svn/morse-sd-stock
problem minimization/morse-bulk
reducer harness
cap 10000
n 100
par2_mean 20000.0
nfailed 100
mean_calls 10000.0
median_calls 10000.0
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 100
n_wrong_stationary 0
